Munger evaluated businesses using:
Business Quality Score = (ROIC * 0.3) + (FCF Margin * 0.25) + (Growth Durability * 0.2) +
Where:
ROIC ≥ 15%
FCF Margin ≥ 10%
Growth Durability: Estimated years of 5% organic growth
Management Score: Capital allocation track record 010 scale)
Firms scoring 8/10 warranted premium valuations. Costco scored 9.2 in 1997 based on:
12% ROIC expanding to 26% by 2023
Membership-driven FCF margins of 3.5%
20+ year growth runway in global retail
